  const contact = '/contact/';
  const steps = [
    ['Consultation & scope','First, we understand your business.',`<p>Every firm and business works differently. We begin with a conversation to understand how your organisation operates and where additional support is needed.</p>${list(['The services or tasks to be outsourced','Your current systems and software','Your client or business requirements','Work allocation and turnaround expectations','Review and approval responsibilities','Communication and reporting preferences'])}<p>This helps us build a delivery process that supports your existing operation rather than disrupting it.</p>`],
    ['10-hour free trial','Test the partnership through real work.',`<p>Use the trial for a live task, a backlog of work, a specific client file or an agreed service area such as bookkeeping, payroll, accounts preparation, tax or audit support.</p><p>Review the output, provide feedback and decide whether to continue. The trial is designed to give you confidence before you make a longer-term decision.</p>`],
    ['Secure onboarding','Agree the access. Document the process.',`<p>Once you choose to proceed, we set up the engagement around your requirements.</p>${list(['Secure system access and permissions','Process notes and checklists','Client or job allocation procedures','Templates and working-paper guidance','Communication channels','Query and escalation procedures','Reporting requirements','Data-protection and confidentiality arrangements'])}<p>FineX operates with GDPR-focused practices and ISO 27001-aligned security controls to support the responsible handling of client and business data.</p>`],
    ['Work handover','Your priorities set the pace.',`<p>Your team decides what work is outsourced, when it is assigned and the deadline required. Work can be handed over through the process that best suits your organisation.</p>${list(['Client folders or secure portals','Task-management systems','Email-based work allocation','Shared work queues','Practice-management platforms','Regular scheduled handovers'])}`],
    ['Processing & queries','Clear instructions. Clear communication.',`<p>FineX processes the work in line with your instructions, agreed scope and internal procedures. Support may include:</p>${list(['Bookkeeping and bank reconciliations','VAT return preparation','Payroll processing and auto-enrolment support','Accounts preparation','Corporation tax and self-assessment processing','Audit support','Data migration','Accounts payable and receivable support','Management accounts and reporting','Finance operations and back-office administration'])}<p>Where queries arise, they are raised clearly so your team can respond quickly and keep the work moving.</p>`],
    ['Review & completion','The final decision stays with you.',`<p>Your FineX team returns the agreed work for review, approval or onward submission, depending on the service and workflow.</p><p>Work is completed in accordance with the instructions, templates and review points agreed during onboarding. You retain ownership of client relationships, review procedures, approval decisions and priorities.</p>`],
    ['Reporting & scale','Keep improving as you grow.',`<p>FineX provides regular updates based on the reporting format agreed with you. Regular feedback allows the process to become more efficient over time.</p><p>As FineX becomes familiar with your systems, templates and expectations, your outsourced team can provide increasingly consistent support. Increase or reduce support as your workload, client base or business requirements change.</p>`]
  ];
